 spell slots: 1 → 2. Wisdom bonus spells and spell-use qualifications are separate.\nPHB p. 20\nIncomplete level-up guide. Attack, saving throw, spell-slot, and skill-table changes have not been exhaustively extracted. Other class mechanics may still be missing; use the source before finalizing the character sheet.\n\nThe selector’s upper bound is a display range, not a class-level cap. Class eligibility and special rank requirements still apply.\n\nYOUR CUMULATIVE XP WITHIN THIS TRACK\nCheck progress\nHighest listed threshold reached: level 1. 1,501 XP to level 2. PHB p. 20\nKNOWN EXPERIENCE THRESHOLDS\n\nSource-listed rows only. Missing levels stay unavailable. XP is cumulative within the labeled track; eligibility and training also apply.\n\nLEVEL\tMINIMUM XP\tNEXT-LEVEL INCREASE\tSOURCE\t\nANNOTATE LEVEL\n\n1\t0\t1,501\tPHB p. 20\t\n\n2\t1,501\t1,500\tPHB p. 20\t\n\n3\t3,001\t3,000\tPHB p. 20\t\n\n4\t6,001\t7,000\tPHB p. 20\t\n\n5\t13,001\t14,500\tPHB p. 20\t\n\n6\t27,501\t27,500\tPHB p. 20\t\n\n7\t55,001\t55,000\tPHB p. 20\t\n\n8\t110,001\t115,000\tPHB p. 20\t\n\n9\t225,001\t225,000\tPHB p. 20\t\n\n10\t450,001\t225,000\tPHB p. 20\t\n\n11\t675,001\t225,000 (derived)\tPHB p. 20\t\n\nHigher thresholds may be derived only from the cited continuation rule and its explicit XP anchor. PHB p. 20\n\nGENERAL CLASS CHECKLIST\n\nThese are general class reminders, separate from the selected level’s changes.\n\nRequires Wisdom 9; some multiclass qualifications differ.\nCheck spell slots, Wisdom bonus spells, and turning ability for the new level.\nAfter level 9, gain 2 hp per level instead of another hit die.\nLevel 8 followers require a qualifying place of worship; level 9 opens the stronghold option.\nRemaining extraction notes 4\nXP indicates a threshold, not automatic advancement. Class prerequisites, campaign eligibility, rank limits, and the Dungeon Master’s training procedure can affect advancement.\nPartial level-up extraction · visual table verification pending\nVie